{"seq":30,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1508"},"reason":"Added the Greek name Pentateuch to the Torah paragraph so the new question about it sits in the sentence that lists the five books.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",176],["-","–"],["+","–,"],["=",1],["+","which scholars call by their Greek name, the Pentateuch, from the Greek words for \"five\" "],["=",2],["+","\"scroll case\", a term first used among the Greek-speaking Jews of Alexandria. The Torah "],["=",935]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",168],["+","–, die die Forschung mit ihrem griechischen Namen Pentateuch nennt, „Fünfgefäß“, nach den Behältern, in denen die Schriftrollen aufbewahrt wurden "],["=",2],["-","und"],["+","ein"],["=",1],["+","Begriff, der zuerst unter den griechischsprachigen Juden Alexandrias aufkam. Die Tora "],["=",893]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",134],["-","Второзаконие"],["+","Второзаконие;"],["=",1],["+","их общее название в науке "],["=",2],["+","Пятикнижие (от греческих слов «пять» "],["=",2],["+","«футляр для свитков»), и этот термин впервые появился у грекоязычных евреев Александрии. Тора "],["=",779]]}],"hash":"2819dee61c93"},
